{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12111240","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12111240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1211124001:0":{"text":"이곳은 꿈속이기도 하고, 보물이 숨겨진 곳이기도 하죠. 여러분이 섬에 도착한 그 순간부터 여러분은 울머스의 꿈속에 들어온 거랍니다.","source_cn":"这里确实是梦境，也是藏宝之地。从你们登上小岛的那一刻起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF8CC6964D297533","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211124002:0":{"text":"울머스는... 그 나무 아닌가요?","source_cn":"奥曼斯……不是那棵树吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51D19AA8FC8FB6A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211124003:0":{"text":"아유, 귀여워라! 기억력이 참 좋네요.","source_cn":"哎呀，真可爱！你的记性真好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66154FBE54395BBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211124004:0":{"text":"그럼, 다시 한번 정식으로 소개하죠! 저는 이곳의 수호자인 <style=\"highlight\">꿈을 지키는 요정</style> ...타시라고 해요.","source_cn":"那么，让我重新做个自我介绍吧。我是这里的保卫者，<st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81868C628A1BD2AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211124005:0":{"text":"트레밀레우스의 부탁으로 저와 울머스는 파도와 표류의 신이 꿈속에 숨겨둔 보물을 지키고 있었어요.","source_cn":"奉特勒米琉斯的嘱托，我和奥曼斯在此地守护着风浪与漂泊之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB98A0C209A03D05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211124006:0":{"text":"모험가 여러분, 여러분은 이미 자신의 의지와 실력을 증명했으니, 보물을 여러분께 드리도록 할게요.","source_cn":"各位冒险家，你们证明了自己的意志与实力，因此，我会将宝...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A514E40A710D9C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211124007:0":{"text":"그건 여러분이 <style=\"highlight\">가장 원하는 것</style>이에요.\n여러분이 <style=\"highlight\">간절히 바라던 것</style>이죠.","source_cn":"那将是各位<style=highlight>最想要的东...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0FCEED57BDD6F5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211124008:0":{"text":"내 건 소니아 언니에게 양보할래!","source_cn":"我的让给索尼娅姐姐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5788E5595DACE4E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211124009:0":{"text":"아휴, 가엽고 귀여운 녀석... 안타깝지만 당신은 보물을 선택할 자격이 없어요.","source_cn":"唉，可怜又可爱的小家伙……虽然这么说很可惜，但是你没有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70CB1D32FAFB9786","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1211124010:0":{"text":"하지만 걱정 마세요! 언니는 원하는 걸 얻을 수 있을 거예요!","source_cn":"但是别担心！你的姐姐一定能拿到她想要的东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x753A81CB06BB4891","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1211124011:0":{"text":"나라는 왜 자격이 없는 거지?","source_cn":"为什么奈拉没有资格？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC0BD653313AB07B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1211124012:0":{"text":"질문을 하기 전에, 여러분의 보상부터 받아가세요.","source_cn":"提问之前，先拿走你们的奖品吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9666F27478398FFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1211124013:0":{"text":"자, 소니아, 당신이 간절히 바라는 게 무엇인지 말해주세요.","source_cn":"来吧，索尼娅，告诉我，你的梦寐之物是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A78B255691BC1FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1211124014:0":{"text":"지금 이 순간, 당신의 눈에 보이는 건 무엇인가요?","source_cn":"此时此刻你的眼中，看到了什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7BC07621CDC88BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1211124015:0":{"text":"블러디 로즈의 지팡이? 그리고...","source_cn":"你是说……这柄血蔷薇权杖？和……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7987761B8950CE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1211124016:0":{"text":"그리고 뭔가요? 당신의 보물은 당신에게만 보여요.","source_cn":"和什么呢？你的宝藏，只有你自己能看到哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D344C17E92F77C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1211124017:0":{"text":"그리고 나라의 리본과 나라가 접은 종이배...","source_cn":"另一个，是奈拉的蝴蝶结和她折的纸船……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72D701791C617C52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1211124018:0":{"text":"선택하기 어려운가요? 지금까지 어떤 선택을 해야 할지 고민하고 있나요?","source_cn":"很难抉择吗？直到现在，你都在纠结应该怎么选？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4DCDCE88C767D1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1211124019:0":{"text":"아니...","source_cn":"不是的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1047DD05087B3BEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1211124020:0":{"text":"욕심은 버려야 해요. 당신이 가장 원하는 한 가지만 줄 수 있으니까요.","source_cn":"可不能贪心哦，我不能全都给你，只能给你最想要的那一个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x191EC3AEF4535CF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1211124021:0":{"text":"...난 됐어. 내 인생은 여기서 선택한다고 해서 변하지 않을 테니까.","source_cn":"……不必了。我的人生，不会因为在这里做出选择而有所改变。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C6066A36F3450CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1211124022:0":{"text":"난 나라를 데리고 러스트 항으로 돌아가서 죽음의 함대를 몰아낼 거야. 어떤 선택을 하든 내가 앞으로 해야 할 일은 변하지 않아.","source_cn":"我要带奈拉回锈锚港，赶走死潮舰队。无论怎么选，都不会影...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DBCD3E7BBBB09B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1211124023:0":{"text":"재밌네요... 보물을 포기한 사람은 당신이 처음이에요.","source_cn":"有意思……第一次碰到愿意放弃宝藏的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86968592E3C73DDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1211124024:0":{"text":"강요하진 않을게요. 이미 선택을 했으니, 행운을 빌어요.","source_cn":"我不会强迫你，既然你已经做出了你的选择，祝你好运。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD95ACFC50B8D5AFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1211124025:0":{"text":"하지만 시련을 통과했으니, 필요하다면 제 발아래에 있는 이 골드를 가져가도록 하세요.","source_cn":"但你毕竟完成了试炼，要是需要的话，就把我脚下这箱金子拿去吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C3D40DC4219755F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1211124026:0":{"text":"그럼, 이제 신밧드 당신의 차례에요!","source_cn":"那么，接下来，到你了——辛巴达！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE5E6AF5C48870A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1211124027:0":{"text":"긴장되네... 어떤 보물을 얻게 될까나.","source_cn":"好紧张……不知道会得到什么样的宝物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x622EFEDAB7E5A0A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1211124028:0":{"text":"보세요, 왼쪽은 금산처럼 쌓인 재물이고, 오른쪽은 은산처럼 쌓인 재물이에요. 어느 쪽은 선택하든, 더 이상 생계를 걱정할 일은 없을 거예요.","source_cn":"瞧，你左边是堆成金山般的财宝，右边是堆成银山般的财宝。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA68DA52DC1288CE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1211124029:0":{"text":"잠깐... 금산? 은산? 다 돈 아닌가?","source_cn":"等等……金山？银山？不都是钱吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x406F717148925949","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1211124030:0":{"text":"왜 그러시죠? 당신이 원하는 건 재물 아니었나요?","source_cn":"怎么了，你一直以来想要的不是财富吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7884A6B11D051BD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1211124031:0":{"text":"이 돈이 있으면 장원이 아니라 성곽을 살 수도 있어요. 당신이 걱정하는 사람들과 다 함께 부족함 없이 평생을 살 수 있으니 유용하지 않나요?","source_cn":"有了这些钱，别说是庄园，连城堡都能买下来。你可以让自己...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D5B5F1D08439A30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1211124032:0":{"text":"마, 맞아... 맞는 말인데...","source_cn":"是、是啊……你说的对……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB46D8A070CAA5773","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1211124033:0":{"text":"좋아요, 그럼 어서 가져가세요.","source_cn":"很好，快把它拿走吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BB06F38B7980ED4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1211124034:0":{"text":"돈... 그래... 돈. 난 돈이 필요했어...","source_cn":"钱……没错……钱。我一直都想要钱……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31E00F0DC1E182DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1211124035:0":{"text":"맞아요, 바로 그거예요. 절 믿으세요, 절대 후회하지 않을 거예요.","source_cn":"对，就是这样。相信我，你不会后悔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0402F6A5D71FD23C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:43:1211124035":{"text":"맞아요, 바로 그거예요. 절 믿으세요, 절대 후회하지 않을 거예요.","source_cn":"对，就是这样。相信我，你不会后悔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0402F6A5D71FD23C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1211124036:0":{"text":"...아! 내가 왜 그랬지...","source_cn":"——啊！我刚刚是怎么了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA781DCBE7BCB68C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1211124037:0":{"text":"고마워! 당신이 아니었다면 저 녀석의 함정에 말려들 뻔했어!","source_cn":"谢谢你！要不是你喊这一嗓子，我差点中了她的计！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC72A79E5C1971055","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"고마워! 당신이 아니었다면 저 녀석의 함정에 말려들 뻔했어!","female":"고마워! 당신이 아니었다면 저 녀석의 함정에 말려들 뻔했어!","variant_male_record_index":"130193","variant_female_record_index":"130194","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1211124039:0":{"text":"결정했어! 내가 정말 원하는 게 뭔지 알았어!","source_cn":"我想清楚了！我知道自己真正想要的是什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x649B73C2308C6D95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1211124040:0":{"text":"번복하는 건가요?","source_cn":"你要反悔吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x778E10DF14070BCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1211124041:0":{"text":"번복이 아니라, 넌 처음부터 내가 진정으로 원하는 선택지를 주지 않았어. 그렇지?","source_cn":"不是反悔，而是你并没有把真正的选项摆在我面前，对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9593E1D417A17B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_tit